# Platform: mobilesite
# Imported from Testsigma: B2B Manage Quotes Page Loading Check (test case 2593, run 115613, last result SUCCESS)
# Tags: regression
# OFF steps: every step that would send a REAL lead / enquiry / OTP is switched off,
#   plus the checks that only pass after it. Switch them on only when a lead is wanted.

call Live_Touch_Chrome_Navigate_to_Homepage_setup_Popup
# OFF: open https://www.justdial.com/
# OFF: wait 2 seconds
call SG_PS_Touch_Home_Login
click touch_signin_home_page
click manage_quotes
wait until element heading_manage_quotes is visible
verify element heading_no_enquiries_found is not visible
click manage_quotes_header_back
click sign_out
call SG_Touch_Core_Login
click touch_signin_home_page
click manage_quotes
wait until element heading_manage_quotes is visible
verify element heading_no_enquiries_found is not visible
